1
00:00:00,391 --> 00:00:04,391
My, uh, parents are making me choose
between money and you.

2
00:00:05,521 --> 00:00:07,561
(Raj:)I choose you.

3
00:00:10,234 --> 00:00:12,824
(Raj:)No. I think we'll have to return
the car.

4
00:00:14,322 --> 00:00:16,452
And the necklace. Yeah, that too.

5
00:00:16,616 --> 00:00:20,366
(Raj:)But none of those things matter
because we have something better.

6
00:00:21,454 --> 00:00:23,204
(Raj:)We have love.

7
00:00:32,715 --> 00:00:36,425
- Oh, Penny, I hurt so bad.
- Uh...

8
00:00:36,594 --> 00:00:38,264
(Penny:)I know. I know.

9
00:00:38,429 --> 00:00:43,099
(Raj:)Sometimes I put the TV on mute
just to pretend she's still with me.

10
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:51,529
But I can't watch the closed-captioning
without crying.

11
00:00:53,945 --> 00:00:56,405
(Penny:)Oh, I'm so sorry.

12
00:00:56,572 --> 00:00:58,742
I wish I can make you feel better.

13
00:00:58,908 --> 00:01:00,368
(Raj:)Seriously?

